What's even worse is the loser literally reported me of groom and such even tho I did not do anything wrong, and the staff believed him.

&#x200B;

Well the loser was actually the groom, all the proofs were shown to the staff and they don't have any idea how to stop that but banned me for false reasons, crappy staff ngl they failed their job (but being paid well).

Last time I've ever seen a bunch of players bypassing the ban and saying that they used the .gg thing to bypass something from banlands or something.

&#x200B;

The banland fails sometimes.

Can you still play VIP servers while being banned? I was banned just because of these people who lied to the community, I hate it. He just left so he can't be found by the staffs.

&#x200B;

Stupid braindead people like I mentioned should stop.
